Subject: Cantor Process Procedure Experiment

Description: Canonical SJS authority for a future separately claimed effectless Simula-inspired semantic stored-procedure experiment with explicit process state, multi-pass shared-inference messages, a portable canonical IR, separated lifecycle receipts, and deterministic software interpretation. It grants no live provider, persistent service, external effect, or hardware authority.

